      "frameId": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "index": null,
      "text": "~/.codeintel/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 scip/_/<slug>/_/\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 current                    <- pointer, 1 line\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 index-<sha>.db             <- versioned, immutable\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 index-<sha>.metadata.json  <- commit_sha, published_at\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 registry.db                    <- slug\u00b7path\u00b7lang\u00b7sha\u00b7status\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 .zoekt/                        <- shards, all repos\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 zoekt-webserver.pid            <- reused across processes",
      "originalText": "~/.codeintel/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 scip/_/<slug>/_/\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 current                    <- pointer, 1 line\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 index-<sha>.db             <- versioned, immutable\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 index-<sha>.metadata.json  <- commit_sha, published_at\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 registry.db                    <- slug\u00b7path\u00b7lang\u00b7sha\u00b7status\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 .zoekt/                        <- shards, all repos\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 zoekt-webserver.pid            <- reused across processes",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
