      "frameId": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "index": null,
      "text": "POSIX rename(2) \u2014 a reader sees either the\nold filename or the new one, never a partial write.\n\nA query already holding an open fd on the old .db\nkeeps reading it safely; unlink() only drops the\ndirectory entry.\n\nConnection-cache key = pointer CONTENT, not mtime\n(mtime is unreliable; content identifies the version).",
      "originalText": "POSIX rename(2) \u2014 a reader sees either the\nold filename or the new one, never a partial write.\n\nA query already holding an open fd on the old .db\nkeeps reading it safely; unlink() only drops the\ndirectory entry.\n\nConnection-cache key = pointer CONTENT, not mtime\n(mtime is unreliable; content identifies the version).",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
