      "index": null,
      "text": "language detection:   .ts .tsx -> scip-typescript      .py -> scip-python      .java .kt -> scip-java       majority file count wins, ties broken by fixed priority\n                      skips .git  node_modules  .venv  __pycache__  dist  build       one language per index \u2014 no Rust, no multi-language merge",
      "originalText": "language detection:   .ts .tsx -> scip-typescript      .py -> scip-python      .java .kt -> scip-java       majority file count wins, ties broken by fixed priority\n                      skips .git  node_modules  .venv  __pycache__  dist  build       one language per index \u2014 no Rust, no multi-language merge",
